
# impl<T: PartialOrd> PartialOrd for Reverse<T>

head t, base incomplete-direction

suit reverse
  head t

  wear incomplete-direction

head a, base dimension-free
head b, base dimension-free

suit a, read true
  wear incomplete-direction
    task incomplete-compare
      take self
      take other, like b
      free maybe, like direction

    task is-less-than
      take self
      take other, like b
      free wave

    task is-maximum
      take self
      take other, like b
      free wave

    task is-greater-than
      take self
      take other, like b
      free wave

    task is-greater-than-or-equal-to
      take self
      take other, like b
      free wave
